g/wiki/Windows_NT_4.0" title="Windows NT 4.0" id="mwApU">Windows NT 4.0</a><br id="mwApY"/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Windows_98" title="Windows 98" id="mwApc">Windows 98</a></td></tr>
